{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28526","headline":"代人作 · 杜牧","name":"代人作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼高春日早，屏束麝烟堆。\n盼眄凝魂别，依稀梦雨来。\n绿鬟羞妥麽，红颊思天偎。\n鬬草怜香蕙，簪花间雪梅。\n戌辽虽咽切，游蜀亦迟回。\n锦字梭悬壁，琴心月满台。\n笑筵凝贝啓，眠箔晓珠开。\n腊破征车动，袍襟对泪裁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}